   "en": "Natsuki Crisis"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja-ro": "なつきクライシス"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A Martial Arts Whirlwind with a Spirited Young Girl Who Loves Karate!\nNatsuki Kisumi is a strong-willed second-year student at Gouju High School and a member of the karate club. Her skills are so impressive that even the club captain, Yanagisawa, recognizes her talent. However, her boyfriend, Osawa, is less enthused about her karate obsession. He wishes she would embrace a more traditionally feminine demeanor.\n\nAnime adaptation: [AniDB](https://anidb.net/anime/3352) | [ANN](https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/encyclopedia/anime.php?id=5329) | [MAL](https://myanimelist.net/anime/2083/Natsuki_Crisis) | [AL](https://anilist.co/anime/2083/Natsuki-Crisis/)\nVideo game adaptation: [IGDB](https://www.igdb.com/games/natsuki-crisis-battle) | [IMDB](https://m.imdb.com/title/tt3788208/)\n\nOfficial Release:\n- Indonesian release by m\u0026c! Comics (2000)",
   "ja": "私立剛柔高校空手部の貴澄なつきは、飛び抜けた才能を持った実力派空手少女。優れた選手を次々スカウトして傘下に集める常東学園の刺客と戦いながら、彼女は自らの空手の意味を問い始める。様々な技を持った刺客に対して、空手で戦う、異種格闘技戦バトルマンガ。作者・鶴田洋久のデビュー作。"
  },
